gn="top" char="(" charoff="50">24 (4)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">51 (13)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">6.6 (3.8&#x02013;11.6)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label/><p>BMI=body mass index; CI=confidence interval; OR=odds ratio.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn2"><label>a</label><p>Adjustments were made for age, educational level, alcohol use, BMI, cigarette smoking, intake of fruits and vegetables, and <italic>Helicobacter pylori</italic> infection.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn3"><label>b</label><p>The index score included symptom characteristics (heartburn only=1 point, regurgitation only=1 point, heartburn and regurgitation combined=1.5 points), nightly symptoms (no=0 point, yes=2 points) and symptom frequency (once a week=0 point, 2&#x02013;6 times a week=1 point, 7&#x02013;15 times a week=2 points, &#x0003e;15 times a week=3 points).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">BMI and risk of oesophageal and cardia adenocarcinoma expressed in OR with 95&#x00025; CI</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/><col align="char" char="("/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="3" align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>Women</bold><hr/></th><th colspan="3" align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>Men</bold><hr/></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>Controls</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>Cases</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><bold>OR<sup>a</sup></bold></